{"title":"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 19","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Rhombus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" />, with side length <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, is rolled to form a cylinder of volume <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> by taping <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/0/840e2b592390eb6ec918fa6f3292716ce170de66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AB}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/b/63b7e5ec2db31e9aded4bb09881b42d1c439fce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{DC}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" />. What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/5/e356d7ca65829651c936488628f12074df2d5218.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin(\\angle ABC)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"90\" height=\"18\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/0/1008061b7b096bab670d6688626e2d5be1db5d41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ \\frac{\\pi}{9} \\qquad \\mathrm{(B)}\\ \\frac{1}{2} \\qquad \\mathrm{(C)}\\ \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\qquad \\mathrm{(D)}\\ \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\qquad \\mathrm{(E)}\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"385\" height=\"43\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/2/d423bf62199e5f6372de91d9c23fe0f39077413b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] pair B=(0,0), A=(6*dir(60)), C=(6,0); pair D=A+C;  draw(A--B--C--D--A); draw(A--(3,0));  label(&quot;\\(A\\)&quot;,A,NW);label(&quot;\\(B\\)&quot;,B,SW);label(&quot;\\(C\\)&quot;,C,SE);label(&quot;\\(D\\)&quot;,D,NE); label(&quot;\\(6\\)&quot;,A/2,NW); label(&quot;\\(\\theta\\)&quot;,(.8,.5)); label(&quot;\\(h\\)&quot;,(3,2.6),E); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"162\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/a/02af54daab44c2b5758af154adb11ef4f6e37323.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$V_{\\mathrm{Cylinder}} = \\pi r^2 h$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"122\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p>Where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/7/ba76b0521bf443597d41b60dee6c91fa4b3b3c67.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C = 2\\pi r = 6$\" width=\"100\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/e/09e23f9cc4de7584740e2a43f18c34f26b1e00b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h=6\\sin\\theta$\" width=\"80\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/a/9bad4d464943c9716787b23f809925dfe2ca6d94.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r = \\frac{3}{\\pi}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"46\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/b/75bf9646b547449f2021263b32a76273f5ebc6a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$V = \\pi \\left(\\frac{3}{\\pi}\\right)^2\\cdot 6\\sin\\theta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"160\" height=\"46\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/f/81ffa634b974d4c692e3823d49a36296ff275ce0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6 = \\frac{9}{\\pi} \\cdot 6\\sin\\theta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"107\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/e/7ae542b75687b59532a8fac6144131aeb9589825.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin\\theta = \\frac{\\pi}{9} \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{(A)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"128\" height=\"33\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B\">2007 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 18\">Problem 18</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 20\">Problem 20</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Pro